On 2007-08-05, ryan <cjhefferan@optusnet.com.au> wrote:
> This is a silly question but i would like to play spork hack but what keys
> do i use to move my charachter? can i configure it to use standard arrow
> keys? i know NAO is similar. Which key do i use to go back to the main menu
> without having to close the connection and reconnect? im so used to playing
